(zb)
the manner in which accounts of a Gram Panchayat shall be audited under sub-section (1) of section 45;
(zc)
the authority which shall carry out the audit, completion and forwarding thereof to the Chief Executive Officer and the
Gram Panchayat under sub-section (2) of section 45;
(zd)
